      <div class="msv__section-hd">
        <h2>Step-by-Step Application Process</h2>
        <p>The Non-Lucrative Visa application for Canadian retirees is straightforward. Follow these six steps to secure residency in Spain.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="msv__process-steps">
        <div class="msv__process-step">
